    {
      "id": "82f8d709796f7a64",
      "category": "ai",
      "title": "Release v0.7.2.post1",
      "summary": "What's Changed v0.7.2.post1 brings FP8 and Prims-TS MoE to Rubin, and lets MoE and linear-attention (GDN) decode keep each of Rubin's two dies on its own memory. It also adds fused normalization and MoE communication kernels for Muse-Spark-Open, plus an FP8-output multi-node NVLink all-reduce reachable through the unified all-reduce API. On Blackwell GPUs, MoE gains StepFun's clamped SwiGLU activation and Kimi K3 MLA prefill gets a one-pass FP8 K/V pack, alongside launch and backend-selection tuning across GEMM, at",
      "url": "https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/releases/tag/v0.7.2.post1",
